# Quality Gate Optimization
RULE: Quality gates must complete in <3 minutes. Use pytest-xdist, skip slow tests in quick mode, synthetic fixtures.
WHY: Fast feedback is essential; parallel agents must not overload.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates-service-template.sh, .cursor/rules/quality-gates.mdc
DO: Use pytest-xdist; mark slow tests; `--tb=short`; `--quick` for fast runs
NEVER: Run slow tests in quick mode; skip parallel execution; exceed 5min total
